Z||000007||Topknot||05-21-2001||07:59 PM||||Ok well what a day!<P>So here I am just a working on the little hoopie trying to get the clutch out.  I have been taking pictures and uploading them in a folder on the web ready for layouts.<P>I am trying to snap as I go along and will be making web pages to document problems and such that I run in to!  Which there are a ton!<P>Now all this is fine and dandy, but to top it all off here I go and get the air compressor and tools to help break out some old rusted bolts...and wouldn't ya know it..like a goober I go and slam the thing on NOT CHECKING which way it was gonna spin and POW!!!!!!!!!!!<P>I now have a most excellent "war" wound...A nicely split right in half Pinky Finger Nail!..to which still to this time has not stopped bleeding...making grabbin the tools a bit harder!! lol..<P>Oh well till laters!!<P>Topknot =]<BR>||||reg||1
